==English==

===Etymology===
{{suffix|en|touch|er}}. The pejorative sense is derived from the sense of "[[touch]]ing" someone for money.

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|ʌtʃə(ɹ)|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# One who [[touches]].
# {{lb|en|bowls}} A [[ball]] lying in contact with the [[jack]].
# {{lb|en|Geordie|pejorative}} A [[toucha]]; one who tries to get something out of others for nothing in return.

===Anagrams===
* {{anagrams|en|Hectour|hectour|retouch}}

