==French==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|frm|fr}} {{m|frm|toucher}}, {{m|frm|touchier}}, from {{etyl|fro|fr}} {{m|fro|tochier||}}, {{m|fro|touchier}}, {{m|fro|tucher}} (compare French doublet {{m|fr|toquer||}} "to offend"), from unattested {{etyl|VL.|fr}} *{{m|la||toccāre|to knock, strike, offend}}, from {{etyl|frk|fr}} {{m|frk|*tokkōn}}, {{m|frk|*tukkōn||to touch}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|fr}} {{m|gem-pro|*tukkōną}}, {{m|gem-pro|*tukkijaną||to jerk, knock, strike, offend}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|fr}} {{m|ine-pro|*dewk-||to lead, pull, draw}}, influenced by proximity to similar forms from {{etyl|gem-pro|fr}} {{m|gem-pro|*tēkaną||to touch}}. Cognate with {{cog|goh|zochhōn||to grasp, seize}}, {{cog|goh|zuchôn||to jerk, tug}}, {{etyl|gml|-}} {{m|gmh|tucken||to tug}}, {{cog|odt|tocken}}, {{m|odt|tucken||to touch, entise}}, {{cog|ang|tucian}}, {{m|ang|tūcian||to mistreat, disturb, torment}}, {{cog|got|𐍄𐌴𐌺𐌰𐌽||to touch|tr=tekan|sc=Goth}}, {{cog|non|taka||to touch grasp}}, {{cog|ang|tacan||to touch, take}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{fr-IPA}}
* {{audio|Fr-toucher.ogg|Audio (France, Paris)|lang=fr}}
* {{rhymes|e|lang=fr}}
* {{homophones|touchai|touché|touchée|touchées|touchers|touchés|touchez|lang=fr}}

===Noun===
{{fr-noun|m}}

# The act of [[touching]] {{qualifier|see below}}.
# A way of touching.
# The sense of [[touch]], [[tactility]].

===Verb===
{{fr-verb}}

# {{lb|fr|transitive}} To [[touch]] (physically).
#: ''Ne me '''touche''' pas !''
#:: ''Don't touch me!''
# {{lb|fr|transitive}} To [[affect]]
#: ''La maladie '''touche''' actuellement 2 millions de personnes.''
#:: ''The disease currently affects 2 million people.''
# {{lb|fr|intransitive|followed by "{{l|fr|à}}"}} To [[try]], to [[try out]].
#: ''Je n'ai jamais '''touché''' au tabac''
#:: ''I've never tried tobacco''
# {{lb|fr|intransitive|colloquial}} Short for [[toucher sa bille]]. To be skillful.
#: ''Ce mec est un ancien critique d'art. Je peux te dire qu'il '''touche''' en peinture !''
#:: ''This guy is a former art critic. Believe me, he knows a thing or two about painting!''
# {{lb|fr|transitive|money, income}} to [[receive]], to [[get]]

